 style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#16324F;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="chat-note"><mxGeometry x="6" y="8" width="768" height="33" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="03-chat-90" value="Unread = max(0, received - read) for each recipient.&#10;A send transaction writes the message and counters together.&#10;guestUid / hostUid / senderUid are string links to users.&#10;roomId / bookingId are context links, not subcollections.&#10;guestName / hostName / roomName are snapshots." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#52697F;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="chat-note"><mxGeometry x="6" y="46" width="768" height="208" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="03-chat-91" value="messages is inside one conversation document, never directly inside the conversations collection. Full logical references: R25-R34 in the companion dictionary.&#10;One ordered renter-Host pair has one conversation. Admin does not automatically have permission to read private messages." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#61778B;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1085" width="2700" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>